BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:implementar-config-tdm@domosonica.com
DTSTAMP:20260203T120000Z
DTSTART:20260209T120000Z
DTEND:20260209T133000Z
SUMMARY:💻 Implementar PCM1690_ConfigTDM()
DESCRIPTION:Configuración TDM del DAC\n\nImplementar:\nPCM1690_ConfigTDM() {\n    // Reg 64: Auto sample rate\n    WriteReg(64\, 0x00);\n    // Reg 65: TDM I2S (FMTDA=0110)\n    WriteReg(65\, 0x06);\n    // Reg 66: All DACs enabled\n    WriteReg(66\, 0x00);\n    // Attenuation: 0dB all channels\n    for (ch=0; ch<8; ch++)\n        WriteReg(72+ch\, 0xFF);\n}
LOCATION:Home
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Código,Drivers,TDM,Día 6
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:reset-sequence@domosonica.com
DTSTAMP:20260203T120000Z
DTSTART:20260209T133000Z
DTEND:20260209T150000Z
SUMMARY:💻 Implementar secuencia de reset DAC
DESCRIPTION:Power-up sequence completa\n\nSecuencia:\n1. Hold RST LOW\n2. Apply MCLK\n3. Wait 1ms\n4. Release RST (HIGH)\n5. Wait 10ms\n6. Configure via I2C\n\nImplementar función robusta
LOCATION:Home
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Código,Drivers,Power,Día 6
END:VEVENT

