BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:audio-powerup-sequence@domosonica.com
DTSTAMP:20260203T120000Z
DTSTART:20260214T133000Z
DTEND:20260214T153000Z
SUMMARY:💻 Implementar Audio_PowerUp_Sequence()
DESCRIPTION:Secuencia completa de encendido\n\nSecuencia:\n1. Enable 3.3V analog (PA10)\n2. Hold all DACs in reset\n3. ADC power down\n4. Start MCLK (SAI1)\n5. Release DACs sequentially (1ms between)\n6. Configure ADC format (I2S\, Slave)\n7. Power on ADC (wait 100ms)\n8. Configure DACs via I2C\n9. Start all DMA\n\nImplementar en audio_init.c
LOCATION:Home
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Código,Power,Secuencia,Día 11
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:audio-powerdown-sequence@domosonica.com
DTSTAMP:20260203T120000Z
DTSTART:20260214T153000Z
DTEND:20260214T170000Z
SUMMARY:💻 Implementar Audio_PowerDown_Sequence()
DESCRIPTION:Secuencia de apagado seguro\n\nSecuencia:\n1. Mute all DACs\n2. Stop all DMA\n3. ADC power down\n4. Put DACs in reset\n5. Stop MCLK\n6. Disable 3.3V analog\n\nTest power cycling
LOCATION:Home
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Código,Power,Día 11
END:VEVENT

