BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:audio-loopback@domosonica.com
DTSTAMP:20260203T120000Z
DTSTART:20260216T123000Z
DTEND:20260216T140000Z
SUMMARY:💻 Implementar audio loopback ADC→DAC
DESCRIPTION:Pipeline completo de audio\n\nImplementar:\nvoid HAL_SAI_RxHalfCpltCallback() {\n    Process_Audio(adc_buffer[0]\, dac_buffer[0]);\n}\n\nvoid Process_Audio(int32_t *in\, int32_t *out) {\n    // Simple passthrough\n    // Futuro: beamforming aquí\n    for (int i = 0; i < samples; i++) {\n        for (int ch = 0; ch < 8; ch++) {\n            out[i*8 + ch] = in[i*2]; // Mono L\n        }\n    }\n}
LOCATION:Home
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:Código,Audio,Loopback,Día 13
END:VEVENT

